     "day": 133,
     "text": "◈ OVERTIME ×1 — wave 4–5 monsters return as RERUNS (+25% HP, +12% damage). Raids come sooner. The table docks your standing −7. Take your seat from Haven to stop the clock."
    },
    {
     "day": 133,
     "text": "🌾 Tribute from The Bloodied arrives — 3,750 kcal of grain into the pantry. Their fields, our fire."
