    {
     "day": 133,
     "text": "🧳 Word from Thornfield: 💀 Nadia Ibrahim died of hunger on day 24."
    },
    {
     "day": 133,
     "text": "🌙 Watchers at the north treeline see torchlight moving in The Bloodied II's camp — and it going dark. Whatever was coming, the doubled watch turned it. The night stays quiet, and everyone at the fire understands why."
    },
    {
     "day": 134,
     "text": "📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. Vasyl is dead. You didn't ask. It knew."
