     "day": 135,
     "text": "Word with the traders: The Bloodied door is clear again. Whatever had them, let go."
    },
    {
     "day": 135,
     "text": "📺 The System waits. The cameras are already rolling. 📺 The billing says EXTREME RISK — almost nobody walks away from this one. 📺 No one has died in this one yet. That you know of. 📺 You are at 100 health. Participate — or refuse, and let the galaxy watch you say no."
    },
